WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.750
What happens to Orwell's 1984 when placed
into the Clockworks?

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:11.190
One paperback copy of 1984 by George Orwell
was placed into SCP-914 on the setting "Very

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.190
Fine."

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:17.430
The output produced was one paperback copy
of 1914 by Coarse Roughwell, a novel containing

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:22.289
the same plot as that of the inputted material,
but with most scenes replaced with locations

00:00:22.289 --> 00:00:24.920
in Site-19 Facility 23.

